<title>DENMARK: Norddeutsche Landesbank issues 4 pct bond due 2002.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche Landesbank issues 4 pct bond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Wednesday by arranger Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER: NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE.</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 200 MILLION DANISH CROWNS. COUPON:FOUR PERCENT.</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2002.  PAYMENT: ANNUALLY ON DECEMBER 20.</p>
<p>ISS DATE: April 24 1997     ISS PRICE: TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
